/-!
# Conditional connections for A.3.18(2)

`Transport` identifies the literal component image under an unmarked
extension equivalence, transfers index three and nonsplitting, and gives
theta(I) = L from a nonsplit model. `MatrixModels` connects the actual PGL3
and standard PGU3 extensions to compatible conjugation on L/O2(L), then
constructs diagonal actors using local noncontainment Yplus ≰ L.

These completed deductions do not yet discharge the full extension-model
reduction. The particular diagonal-field groups of A.3.16 must instantiate
the nonsplit model inputs, and the rank-one local placement must be proved
from the standing setup and 15.3.2--12, 15.3.25 and 15.3.33. In particular,
noncontainment of theta(I) does not by itself give noncontainment of Yplus.
The source assembly remains open until these premises are discharged.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), A.3.16--18,
printed pp.51--52, and 15.3.37 and 15.3.43, pp.1135 and 1139.
-/
